      "side": 1,
      "message": "This though is correct. The glyphs subpixel position is not baked into the return value of `generatePath`. Currently it\u0027s up to the caller of `generatePath` (generally `SkScalerContext::internalGeneratePath`) to apply the glyphs subpixel positioning to the path. This should be better documented and possibly changed for sanity.",
      "revId": "1eb7c70443372cdaa39f3bac422c3d7c1a97e0c2",
